  "note": "Isolated probe for 3D49. duel-2 crashed in 80211BD0 with SIGBUS at a garbage pointer: that helper takes a roster slot's unit-instance pointer (roster base 8015E10C, side stride 0x258, slot stride 0x14, field +0x0C) and walks the unit's list at +0x2C count / +0x30 pointer with stride 0x24, without validating the pointer. The stock deployment block held neither combatant named by table 800C9A18 entries 15/16, so the read returned garbage. 3D49 therefore needs its two actors ON THE MAP, not a battle context. This version deploys all four actors used by the two probed pairs. Table 800C9A18 has 37 entries of seven halfwords (index, actor, ?, ?, HP, morale, ?) ending at 999; the original pairs a high-HP/high-morale entry with a 10-HP/0-morale one.",
